<title>CHINA: China to grant Allianz licence soon - Brittan.</title>
<headline>China to grant Allianz licence soon - Brittan.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China will soon announce it will grant a domestic licence to the German insurance group Allianz, European Commission Vice President Sir Leon Brittan said on Friday.</p>
<p>Brittan, who is currently visiting Beijing as head of a European trade delegation, also told reporters that other licences to conduct operations in China would be granted to British and French insurance firms in future.</p>
</text>
